    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just that... it feels so pointless. i used to have a path, i had people, i had a future. now i'm just sitting here in this quiet apartment and no one even calls to check in. it feels like the world just moved on without me because i wasn't willing to be complicit. like i'm already dead to them anyway.",
