    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "you're right about the game. i feel like i'm just standing in the way of everything now. the more i try to hold onto what's left, the more it just slips through my fingers. there's no way back to how things were, and even if there was, i don't think i want it back. it's just a constant, heavy weight. i'm just so tired of fighting for a life that feels like it's already over.",
